The fix is applied. The bug was that `b.url === inc.url` does a case-sensitive comparison, so URLs differing only by hostname case (e.g., "https://example.com/a" vs "https://EXAMPLE.com/a") weren't recognized as duplicates. The fix uses `.toLowerCase()` on both sides to make the comparison case-insensitive.


